hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"248","Qāla rasūlu llāhi ṣallā llāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallam: \"Wa-llāhi innī la-ʾastaghfiru llāha wa-ʾatūbu ʾilayhi fī l-yawmi ʾakthara min sabʿīna marra-tan.\". The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said: \"By Allah, I seek forgiveness from Allah and repent to Him more than seventy times a day.\""
"249","\"O people, repent to Allah, for I verily repent to Him one hundred times a day. Reference: Muslim 4/2076."
